    {
      "id": "text_b_core_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 612.5600000000001,
      "height": 210.60000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d0ebff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 100041,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793401489366,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Zero side-effects: NEVER directly accesses process.env, fs, git, or network.\nAll I/O inverted via dependency-injected ports (ports.ts).\n\n• FsPort & GitPort (Working tree snapshot & diffs)\n• LlmPort (OpenAI-compatible client with retry & fallback)\n• ProcessPort (Isolated execution runner)\n• ClockPort & IdPort (Deterministic testability)\n\nAdapters:\n  - local.ts: CLI, Stop hook, Stdio MCP server, Alan plugin\n  - web.ts: Next.js web application (network-only subset)\n  - mock.ts: 100% deterministic fixture test harness",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Zero side-effects: NEVER directly accesses process.env, fs, git, or network.\nAll I/O inverted via dependency-injected ports (ports.ts).\n\n• FsPort & GitPort (Working tree snapshot & diffs)\n• LlmPort (OpenAI-compatible client with retry & fallback)\n• ProcessPort (Isolated execution runner)\n• ClockPort & IdPort (Deterministic testability)\n\nAdapters:\n  - local.ts: CLI, Stop hook, Stdio MCP server, Alan plugin\n  - web.ts: Next.js web application (network-only subset)\n  - mock.ts: 100% deterministic fixture test harness",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
