    {
      "id": "text_b_bite_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 580.32,
      "height": 193.05,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#d3f9d8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 100044,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793401489366,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Answers: \"Do added tests FAIL when the change is removed?\"\n\n1. Candidate Selection: Only added/modified hunks (+3 named, +2 keyword)\n2. Detached Worktree: git worktree add --detach <tmp>/cp-<runId>\n   - Copy-on-write symlinked node_modules with install guards\n3. Head Run: Baseline execution (must pass, else broken_on_head)\n4. Mutation Strategy:\n   - STUB MODE: If change added functions, ts-morph AST replaces\n     function body with 'return undefined' (avoids import errors)\n   - REVERT MODE: git checkout <baseSha> -- <source files>\n5. Re-run: If all pass → TOOTHLESS (✗). If all fail → BITES (✓)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Answers: \"Do added tests FAIL when the change is removed?\"\n\n1. Candidate Selection: Only added/modified hunks (+3 named, +2 keyword)\n2. Detached Worktree: git worktree add --detach <tmp>/cp-<runId>\n   - Copy-on-write symlinked node_modules with install guards\n3. Head Run: Baseline execution (must pass, else broken_on_head)\n4. Mutation Strategy:\n   - STUB MODE: If change added functions, ts-morph AST replaces\n     function body with 'return undefined' (avoids import errors)\n   - REVERT MODE: git checkout <baseSha> -- <source files>\n5. Re-run: If all pass → TOOTHLESS (✗). If all fail → BITES (✓)",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
